---
import importedDemo from '../data/private-demo.json';
const demo=importedDemo;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="description" content="知りたいことを知るために、英語を読む。日英対訳・注釈付きの読書ライブラリ。">
<script is:inline>(()=>{let t;try{t=localStorage.getItem("aw-theme")}catch{}document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t==="dark"||(t!=="light"&&matchMedia("(prefers-color-scheme: dark)").matches)?"dark":"light"})();</script><link rel="icon" href="/brand/mark.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/>
<title>個人教材 — The Annotated World</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/workspace-world.css">
<script define:vars={{ demo }}>window.AW_DEMO=demo;</script><script is:inline defer src="/legacy/app.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">本文へ</a>
<header class="masthead"><button id="home" class="wordmark"><img src="/brand/mark.svg" alt="" width="26" height="26"/> The Annotated World<span>READ THE WORLD, NOT JUST ENGLISH.</span></button><nav aria-label="メイン"><a href="/">公開ライブラリ</a><button type="button" id="workspace-theme" aria-pressed="false">ダーク</button><button id="libraryNav">ライブラリ</button><button id="savedNav">保存した発話</button><label class="action" for="importFile">＋ 個人教材を追加</label><input type="file" id="importFile" accept=".html,.htm,.json,text/html,application/json" class="visually-hidden"></nav></header>
<p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
<main id="main" tabindex="-1">
<section id="library"><div class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow aw-private-mark"><img src="/brand/archive-seal.svg" width="32" height="32" alt=""/>08 / PRIVATE STUDY · 個人読書室</p><h1>My reading<br>room<span>.</span></h1><p class="lead">知りたいことを知るために、英語を読む。<br>原文、和訳、言葉の解説をひとつのページに。</p></div><div class="editorial-note"><img src="/brand/rooms/private-room-vignette.webp" alt="" width="760" height="300" decoding="async"><span>PERSONAL COLLECTION</span><p>ブラウザ内に保存する個人教材</p><small>LOCAL ARCHIVE / HTML · JSON</small></div></div>
<div class="shelf-heading"><h2>Library <span>個人教材・サンプル</span></h2><label>検索 <input type="search" id="search" placeholder="タイトル・著者・テーマ"></label></div><div id="shelf"></div><div class="import-hint"><h3>自分の読みたいものを持ち込む。</h3><p>対訳HTMLまたはJSON教材を追加できます。ファイルはブラウザ内で処理されます。</p><label for="importFile" class="action">教材ファイルを選択</label></div></section>
<section id="reader" hidden><header id="readerHeader"></header><div class="reader-layout"><aside><details id="chapterDetails" open><summary>チャプター</summary><nav id="chapters" aria-label="チャプター"></nav></details></aside><div class="reading"><div class="toolbar"><span id="position"></span><div><button id="translation" aria-pressed="true">和訳</button><button id="notes" aria-pressed="true">注釈</button><button id="highlights" aria-pressed="true">重要語句</button></div></div><article id="chapter" aria-labelledby="chapterTitle"></article><div class="pager"><button id="prev">← 前の章</button><button id="next">次の章 →</button></div></div></div></section>
<section id="saved" hidden><p class="eyebrow">YOUR COMMONPLACE BOOK</p><h1 class="small-title">保存した発話</h1><div id="savedList"></div></section>
</main>
<footer><strong>The Annotated World</strong><span>原典を尊重し、言葉と世界を読む。</span></footer>
<noscript>このリーダーにはJavaScriptが必要です。</noscript>
<script is:inline>(()=>{const b=document.getElementById("workspace-theme");const sync=()=>{const d=document.documentElement.dataset.theme==="dark";b.textContent=d?"ライト":"ダーク";b.setAttribute("aria-pressed",String(d))};b.addEventListener("click",()=>{const t=document.documentElement.dataset.theme==="dark"?"light":"dark";document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t;try{localStorage.setItem("aw-theme",t)}catch{}sync()});sync()})();</script></body></html>